BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ICE Out of Our Neighborhoods
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T170000
UID:c7af0b552d21a50a1a2757867656f7bc@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Messenger_creation_7C9D4A5F-48C9-4548-9C44-614368A38994_20260
 715003819384782.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Please join the community for a rally against ICE atrocities a
 nd vigil for Lorenzo\, Joan and all those murdered by ICE. Bring candles &
  signs. Friday\, 7/17 at 6:30 pm at the Historic Courthouse of Flemington 
 Parking: https://www.historicflemington.com/resident/maps/610-borough-park
 ing-lot-map/file More details to come
LOCATION:Historic Courthouse of Flemington\, 71 Main St\, Building #3\, Fl
 emington\, NJ\, 08822
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ionj/event/990212/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible One NJ (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
